    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d802">

                <pb facs="1269" n="1255" sameAs="frus:frus1944v01/pg1255"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.00116 European War/10–1144: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in the United Kingdom</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Winant</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">London</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-10-11">October 11,
                        1944</date>.<lb/>[Received October 11—2:37 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>8578. Reference Embassy’s airgram A–1225, October 9.<anchor n="45"
                        xml:id="d802-f1"/> Following announcement of Foreign Office was broadcast
                    yesterday evening by BBC and appeared in today’s newspapers: <quote
                        rend="blockquote">
                        <p>“The Polish Government have notified His Majesty’s Government that they
                            have received reliable information that the German authorities are
                            planning the mass execution of the inmates of the concentration camps at
                            Oświęcim and Brzezinky (Birkenau). In these camps thousands of people
                            from many European countries are imprisoned.</p>
                        <p>“His Majesty’s Government wish to make it clear, beyond any possibility
                            of doubt that if this plan, or any similar plan elsewhere, is in fact
                            carried out, they will hold responsible all those who are in any way
                            involved, from the highest to the lowest, and in full cooperation and
                            agreement with the Allies will spare no effort to bring them to
                            justice.”</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Winant</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
